&#x20;               **return `**

&#x20;                   **<div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition flex flex-col">**

&#x20;                       **<div class="relative h-44 bg-slate-100 cursor-pointer overflow-hidden group" onclick="openZoomImage('${safeImg}', '${safeName}')">**

&#x20;                           **<img src="${safeImg}" alt="${safeName}" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-300">**

&#x20;                           **<span class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 shadow-xs">**

&#x20;                               **🏭 ${item.brand || 'Sin Marca'}**

&#x20;                           **</span>**

&#x20;                       **</div>**

&#x20;                       **<div class="p-4 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-3">**

&#x20;                           **<div>**

&#x20;                               **<span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600 uppercase tracking-wider">${item.type || 'Sustrato'}</span>**

&#x20;                               **<h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base leading-snug">${item.name}</h3>**

&#x20;                               **<p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">📦 Medida: ${item.measure || 'N/A'}</p>**

&#x20;                           **</div>**

&#x20;                           **<div class="bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">**

&#x20;                               **${buyPriceHTML}**

